  "ai.orion81Builds": "Orion-81 oya tungwa pa osoftiwea ya yeulwa ya shangwa kaantu. Oya shangwa apa molwaashi ihe ya ningwa kAI.",
  "ai.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 oprojekta ya ningwa ayihe kAI.<\/0> Okoda keshe yaOrion-81 yene oya shangwa ko Claude Code, ya tungilwa komutameki. Oshikepa keshe, ekarata, etekisitela nelaka keshe oya ningwa kiilongitho ya shangwa ko Claude Code. Omuyambidhi ota hogolola shoka sha pumbwa okuningwa; Claude Code ota tala ngoka oshi ningwa ngiini. Omalaibrari ya yeulwa ngoka a tungilwa pa oya shangwa metango mepango «Ihe ya ningwa kAI». Oshinima shimwe oshi li natango oshi li ponhele ya yeulwa nenge: <1>etalo lyelisensa<\/1> lyokoda yogeyimi ya zi koprototipa ya GPL.",
  "ai.orionBegan28": "Orion oya tameka mefiku 28 Septemba 2026 ngaashi oprototipa pa enjini ya yeulwa ya Quake III Arena (GPL), noiikepa yaElite Dangerous ya li oshihongwa shayo. Mefiku etiyali okoda yogeyimi oya ya pa BuB, enjini ompe ya shangwa ko Claude Code; omamodula gogeyimi oga zi koprototipa ndele ga lukilwa omadhina. Ekwatafano 0.3.0 olya gandja iikalo aishe 16 yiikepa omahala omape ayo yene. Etalo lyokukala po kwa pamba elisensa otali tala ngele okoda yimwe oya zi natango pegameno lya GPL nenge omaungaunga gopetameko gokuninga iikepa oge li popepi unene naashoka sha li oshihongwa. Etaleko lyokukonakona okoda lya ningwa ko kompiuta ne prototipa ya GPL olya ningwa mefiku 8 Oktoba 2026, netalo lyaaleli lyomafaneko gawo olyo li li mokulongwa. Shoka sha zi po otashi shangwa ishewe nenge sha ungaungwa ishewe.",
