  "d.109szp9": "Evi enyanyalala nenge iitungwa ya pumbwa okuyakwa.",
  "d.10azxrl": "Omapukululo gatatu gomeundi pombanda yefotosifera. Ethano olo omwenyo: oshikwatelo shoplatifomu, okomete, omiwili ominene. Omalaga ohe ya konima yomaminute ogendji.",
  "d.10wlatv": "Onyanyu yoye yene ekanale lyayo lyomuyelele li li pevi ya 0x40 ohai i tala ngaashi STOCK, onghee oshikwatelo kasha kala shi hashi monika nande.",
  "d.11cuwtu": "OMAROKETI",
  "d.11jyj1n": "Omutonati wa tungwa pamwe noreyiligani yomwaalu ya okule, nomatare gomalasa nomahala omulongo nuhamano gomaroketi.",
  "d.11phsqq": "Omuyoleki gwegeyimi ngoka ha taamba oinima ya ningwa ayihe kAI 100% ota yoleke ogeyimi.",
  "d.11zjijr": "Iilwifo otayi dulu okuyaulwa nokukitikwa (iilwifo ya kitikwa oya holekwa), ndele iikepa kayi tsikile okutwala omwishi.",
  "d.11zq7hg": "Okutalika: omakokpiti ga yelekwa pamukalo gwashili, omaulu ga yelekwa, ogasi onene ya na eringi, ogalaksi nehangano lyondjila yomoulu, omwishi gwoenjini nomatango gokuyenda; omukalo gwokudhana gwa 0.1.0 owa tsikwa.",
  "d.12zyt91": "ANVIL, efano lohanga okuza momenu yogeyimi (omwili ngaashi wa ningwa ko 0.3.0 nokonima; oukulu washili 256 x 128). Efano logeyimi, oversio 0.6.1",
  "d.13cb0px": "Aatondi pombanda yombala, nomwishi gwoenjini (GLASGOW). Efano logeyimi, oversio 0.5.3",
  "d.1436q76": "Oversio 0.5.1 oya tsikwa: omahala gokuamba, omavolei gomaroketi gamwe nahamu, nohanga yaANVIL ya tumu 10 yaNEEDLE.",
  "d.14s5uo6": "Omwishi gwoenjini poshikepa oshinene nomulwi. Efano logeyimi, oversio 0.5.3",
  "d.14vqvyw": "ANVIL na ohanga yayo ya yeulwa. Efano logeyimi, oversio 0.6.1",
  "d.14zbb1f": "Omulwi omunini ta dhengwa kongundu yomatondi mofelda yomamanya THETA-7, ombulu yoshikwatelo shaye tai yaluka.",
