  "d.2pbr86": "Pokati",
  "d.2r8k8j": "OMEULU",
  "d.2sqinp": "Iikepa ntatu na omwishi gwoenjini pombanda yaGlasgow ya hawe, ya hongwa koshikepa shomuhongi pomesho.",
  "d.2vomdh": "Etaleko lyokukonakona okoda yogeyimi ne prototipa ya GPL olya ningwa mefiku {date0}. Etalo lyaaleli lyomafaneko gawo olyo li li mokulongwa. Shoka sha monika tashi kopiwa nenge tashi pewa ishewe otashi shangwa ishewe.",
  "d.32ogvm": "Omwishi gwoenjini gwa yelekwa komulumbu, ANVIL ya 240 m na ohanga ya talika nomalupale, NEEDLE tayi tuma okomambinga gavali, ATTACK yomukwanyoko gumwe nenge wopopepi, nomaANVIL gAI ga tuma omakumbu gawo.",
  "d.3b0pca": "OMUTALI",
