  "d.3m3q6c": "Ouyeli weundi, nomalaga ga ya konima yomaminute ogendji.",
  "d.3wpyge": "Omakilometa omulongo nuhamano gombala pomulonga Clyde kombanda yeulu lya yenga lya hawe. Outoto wevi washili, ombepo yashili, omalenga nomakreni: kala u na ongudhi ndele ino pita pomulonga.",
  "d.4b5t91": "PERIHELION, 4 SOLAR RADII, efano lehala okuza momenu yogeyimi. Efano logeyimi, oversio 0.6.1",
  "d.4p55jj": "iikalo yiikepa",
  "d.4pqks5": "Okoda yogeyimi oya ya pa BuB, enjini ompe ya shangwa ko Claude Code. Omamodula gogeyimi oga zi koprototipa ndele ga lukilwa omadhina konima.",
  "d.4wz1ss": "Epandja lyaLOADOUT embo keshe lyoshikonda (omuntu umwe nelobi lyokudhana pamwe) na omiyelo dhomwili noshikwatelo, onyanyu yoshikwatelo, omahala gehala keshe lyokuamba noikepa yohanga yaANVIL.",
  "d.5h9ajx": "OMALASA",
  "d.5zdnfb": "Ele: kape na ekwato.",
  "d.61r5q7": "OHANGA NA 10 NEEDLES",
  "d.6mw8fz": "Omabatteria gomatare gomalasa nomagani ge ha tameke mu AUTO.",
  "d.6vf32z": "Oversio 0 (edemo) oya tsikwa: iikalo 8 yiikepa, omalasa nepepelo lyomaroketi, ofelda yomamanya THETA-7.",
  "d.6wbq2y": "Ediski lyeundi, efano limwe lyomutali gwomakarata.",
  "d.709qra": "Kwata opo u yadhe, efa opo u pepele. Okufa pa 50 % yokuyadha nenge pombanda otaku pepele; pevi yaasho otaku ekelehi.",
  "d.7a27ds": "Omahala gomatumbi gokuamba, omavolei gomaroketi gahamano na kamera tai landula, okuyamba kwavali, omalasa gaANVIL, ohanga yaANVIL tai tuma NEEDLES 10 yoshigwana shimwe, nelelo lyokutenguka kwa kamera.",
  "d.7xvt5u": "Aishe oya ningwa kAI pa enjini yaBuB, nokulongitha Claude Code.",
  "d.87vl1g": "Okudhana pamwe mowetu wopepi (konga omakonda pamwe naWi-Fi, hogela nenge ya molobi, tameka pamwe; omakwatafano gokudhana pamwe nogomuntu keshe) nomakarata omape gatatu: LUNA, EARTH ORBIT na SOL.",
  "d.899luq": "THRESHER ngaashi i li momenu yohanga yogeyimi, omwili woversio 0.6.1, okutala kwa pambinga pomwiidhi.",
