  "d.kddlvb": "Oshiyendi shoreyiligani tashi kala konima yokudhengwa. Efano logeyimi, oversio 0.6.1",
  "d.kg7xsi": "Ovolei yomaroketi, efano limwe lyelabo lyiilwifo.",
  "d.khkezi": "Omulwi, ombulu yoshikwatelo shaye ya yelekwa, mokati komawe gaTHETA-7. Efano logeyimi, oversio 0.6.1",
  "d.l1nhkh": "Oshipepelo shomaroketi taga ya novolei. Efano logeyimi, oversio 0.5.2",
  "d.lfm0mz": "Omutwali woiinima yombinga gwa lenga ngaashi eduliko lyoshitopolwa shombala. Omatare nekwatelo lyoshikoti, kape na oshikwata sha tya.",
  "d.lomr5e": "RAMPART, efano lohanga okuza momenu yogeyimi (omwili ngaashi wa ningwa ko 0.3.0 nokonima; oukulu washili 256 x 128). Efano logeyimi, oversio 0.6.1",
  "d.m3odu3": "Oshikepa shomagani tashi fluka: ogani yimwe onene yokombanda, omalasa gavali, omatare gavali ge mu kalu mwene noreyili ohepe yohonga.",
  "d.mmkrqn": "Ya twalwa pa BuB nokulukilwa omadhina. Etaleko lyokukonakona okoda ne prototipa olya ningwa mefiku {date0}; etalo lyaaleli lyomafaneko gawo olyo li li mokulongwa",
  "d.mubbp2": "PATHFINDER, efano lohanga okuza momenu yogeyimi (omwili ngaashi wa ningwa ko 0.3.0 nokonima; oukulu washili 256 x 128). Efano logeyimi, oversio 0.6.1",
  "d.mujtj0": "Odrenota: oshitopolwa shoshikwata, oreyili ya tuku yohonga nomatare ane gareyili ga tulwa pavali.",
  "d.nrv8s2": "Omareyiligani gohonga ga tuku koikepa iinene.",
  "d.nuhm57": "Iikalo hetatu yiikepa, omalasa nepepelo lyomavolei, nofelda yomamanya THETA-7.",
  "d.p1uh6f": "Oprototipa otai tameke pa enjini ya yeulwa (GPL) yaQuake III Arena, noiikepa yaElite Dangerous ya li oshihongwa shayo.",
  "d.pimdbg": "Oversio 0.4.0 oya tsikwa: okutalika kwashili: omwenyo gwefano, okuuvithwa kwomatango, omwenyo gwomaulu ga yela.",
  "d.pp01v0": "NEEDLE ngaashi i li momenu yohanga yogeyimi, omwili woversio 0.6.1, okutala kwa pambinga pomwiidhi.",
  "d.qwk107": "Omawe ge li mokuyenda nokupindila; oshiwe oshinene kashi na okukonda ko kasha.",
  "d.r70f4w": "THETA-7 neulu nomawe gaversio 0.5.0. Efano logeyimi, oversio 0.5.0",
  "d.rap4k0": "BRAWLER, efano lohanga okuza momenu yogeyimi (omwili ngaashi wa ningwa ko 0.3.0 nokonima; oukulu washili 256 x 128). Efano logeyimi, oversio 0.6.1",
  "d.reost1": "Omulwi a kwatelwa oshikwatelo ta pepele omukanda gwolasa koshikasha shomukwanyoko.",
  "d.rexwmq": "Kwata okapuni opo u pepele. Iigwana yiikalo yoshikepa ohayi li ya gandjana keshe efimbo lyokupepela, noogani aishe dhi na ehala limwe nomatare gomalasa mongundu yopaife otaga pepele.",
  "d.sdtkzv": "Epandja lyaLOADOUT lyaORION-1 na omiyelo dhomwili noshikwatelo, onyanyu yoshikwatelo nomatenda gomahala gokuamba.",
  "d.sp0f4k": "Oha pe omiyelo dhomwiti gwoshikwatelo 3 (STANDARD EMITTER, HARDENED EMITTER, DEEP-FIELD EMITTER).",
  "d.sudba1": "POINT DEFENCE",
  "d.svcsep": "Outoto wevi 1.62 m/s2 (0.165 g).",
  "d.taax41": "Elogo laOrion-81: omatango gatatu ga yaluka ga eveya noshiindi mokati komukoki gwasilfa gwa tulukwa.",
  "d.tbfe8v": "Omidhike dha ekelwa, omatuku gomapulo ga ningwa.",
  "d.tg0hgk": "Omawe ge na omaringi nomakoma gofelda yomamanya THETA-7.",
  "d.tg8bac": "MERIDIAN ngaashi i li momenu yohanga yogeyimi, omwili woversio 0.6.1, okutala kwa pambinga pomwiidhi.",
  "d.tg8pdz": "Oha pe onyanyu dhoshikwatelo 8, pamwe nonyanyu yoye yene.",
  "d.th2bvi": "Omahala, pagandjo: L1, id yoshikalo, edigiti lyomwili + edigiti lyoshikwatelo, onyanyu, omatiki gomahala gokuamba, id yoshikepa, edigiti lyomwili woshikepa + edigiti lyoshikwatelo shoshikepa, omatiki gomahala gokuamba goshikepa. Onyanyu oyo '-' kuSTOCK, 'p<k>' koshiwike k yepaleta, nenge omadigiti gahamano ga hex gomaleta manini. Ehala olo STOCK ngele li li '00' (omiyelo), '-' (onyanyu, oshikepa) nenge ewanda (omahala gokuamba); ehala keshe lyetameko konima yehala lyahugunina lyihe etameko olya efiwa po, lyokomeho olya kalelwa. Omahala goshikepa oga kala po ashike koshikalo shi na ohanga. Ehoololo oshikalo kasha dulu okulikwata ohali i tala ngaashi STOCK.",
  "d.tjh47s": "Ouyeli ohau ya pokupepela keshe kongundu; omagani oga yela fiyo pehulilo ndele ga kuthwa konima.",
  "d.tnqgr2": "Okoda yogeyimi ya zi koprototipa ya GPL",
  "d.tqhusf": "Omagani ga tsikwa oge hondola kehala lyoshikalo lyokuya pamwe; omatare oge hondola kehala lyokutonga lyomukwanyoko mokati kepululo lyawo.",
  "d.uq3bbi": "OMAREYILIGANI",
  "d.v0hnua": "Ya ningwa aatatekulu ovo inava mona efimbo lyokukala ngaashi vo vene mouhandimwe.",
  "d.va88ub": "Oversio 0.1.0 oya tsikwa: okutalika kwashili kwa SF, omaroketi neoreyiligani, iikepa 16 okuza po 12 m fiyo 1.2 km, ekarata lyaGlasgow.",
  "d.vktsja": "OMUTONATI",
  "d.vway3": "Kwata okapuni koroketi opo u pepele omatondi. Omatumi ohaga pepele pagandjo ndele omagasini aeshe oga yadhwa ishewe nge ga pwa.",
  "d.w9u9l8": "Otwa pumbwa okuuva omapumbwo aeshe gepango lyokuyoleka ogeyimi ya ningwa ayihe kAI 100%.",
  "d.wqqgrq": "Ekwatelo lyoshikoti ohali longo li yene: omatare gaPD otaga pepele omaroketi omatondi mokati ko 1.5 km, ndele kali li pokapuni nande.",
  "d.x2k8or": "Oenjini ya tulwa okokpiti. Omalasa gavali, omagani gavali gepepo lyomapwa nomwili gwa ya mbala ngoka u li moshitopolwa: kwata, galuka, ndele ishewe.",
  "d.xd9o89": "OMUKWATI NOILONGA ONYENGI",
  "d.xee72g": "ORION-1, efano lohanga okuza momenu yogeyimi (omwili ngaashi wa ningwa ko 0.3.0 nokonima; oukulu washili 256 x 128). Efano logeyimi, oversio 0.6.1",
  "d.xnwaaf": "Ehala lyokulwa lya fa omudhingoloko li na omuhingo omuhepe pomwaalu gwa 8 km.",
  "d.xtzt3d": "Oversio 0.5.3 oya tsikwa: ANVIL ya 240 m ya na ohanga ya talika nokutuma kwaNEEDLE komambinga aeshe gavali.",
  "d.xus0g5": "Omatare gomalasa nomagani otaga dulu okutulwa keshe gumwe ku MANUAL nenge AUTO.",
  "d.y0cdyl": "Omagani ga tsikwa, omatare gomagani nokaCIWS oge li ngoongundu yimwe yomagani; omatare nokaCIWS oge ya pomagasini gamwe gomatare.",
  "d.y22qv5": "IRONCLAD, efano lohanga okuza momenu yogeyimi (omwili ngaashi wa ningwa ko 0.3.0 nokonima; oukulu washili 256 x 128). Efano logeyimi, oversio 0.6.1",
  "d.yabbmd": "CARAVAN, efano lohanga okuza momenu yogeyimi (omwili ngaashi wa ningwa ko 0.3.0 nokonima; oukulu washili 256 x 128). Efano logeyimi, oversio 0.6.1",
  "d.ygdahp": "Oversio 0.6.1 oya tsikwa: omaANVIL gAI gomukwanyoko ga tumu omakumbu gawo, noiikepa tai galuka mohanga.",
  "d.ygdciu": "Omakwatafano gaLAN ayehe nayehe",
  "d.ykoysr": "KESTREL ngaashi i li momenu yohanga yogeyimi, omwili woversio 0.6.1, okutala kwa pambinga pomwiidhi.",
  "d.yz0shp": "Iikepa yomukuluntu fiyo 351.4 m (ouleleli waBASTION) otayi dulu okuhonga mpaka.",
  "d.yzucb5": "IRONCLAD ngaashi i li momenu yohanga yogeyimi, omwili woversio 0.6.1, okutala kwa pambinga pomwiidhi.",
  "d.zemkuh": "Kala poshitumbi shehala lyokuamba ndele pepela mo.",
  "d.zflx86": "Elaibrari lya yeulwa lya hanganekwa mogeyimi",
  "d.zitf93": "Omaminigani ge hondola momeyelo gatatu: 3 000, 2 000 na 1 800 rpm pogani keshe pehondolo lyaye ayihe (iikalo yi na 20, 30 na 35 mm).",
  "d.zpe8n2": "Ekwatelo lyoshikoti lyomagani ohali ithanwa CIWS, lyomomukalo gwa pokati nogwa tuku.",
