  "economy.todayHead": "Shoka sha li po ngashingeyi",
  "economy.todayLead": "Omiyelo dhomwili noshikwatelo nonyanyu dhoshikwatelo dhepandja lyaLOADOUT (0.6.0) otadhi holola oshikalo shomayelekeko niikwatelo oikonomi ya hala okupa.",
  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Molwaashi oimaliwa yayo oya hala okufuta aantu. Ogeyimi otai tameke ya ningwa ayihe kAI opo i dule okukala po; aadizaina ya futwa konima otaa tule po oilonga yAI, ya tseyithwa pedhina.",
  "faq.canIPlay": "Ondi dulu okudhana konlaina?",
  "faq.freePlay": "Okudhana okwa ehameka?",
  "faq.n07Questions": "07 · Omapulo",
  "faq.notYetLan": "Hasho natango. Okudhana pamwe naLAN mowetu umwe otaku longo ngashingeyi (okuza ko 0.2.0); okudhana konlaina kaku ningwa.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "Oprototipa oya tungwa pa enjini ya yeulwa yaQuake III Arena (GPL) ndele oya tula iikepa yaElite Dangerous ngaashi oshihongwa. Mefiku etiyali okoda yogeyimi oya ya pa BuB, enjini ompe ya shangwa ko Claude Code; omamodula gogeyimi oga zi koprototipa ndele ga lukilwa omadhina. Ekwatafano 0.3.0 olya gandja iikalo aishe 16 yiikepa omiwili omipe. Etalo lyokukala po kwa pamba elisensa otali tala ngele okoda yimwe oya zi natango pegameno lya GPL nenge omaungaunga gopetameko gokuninga iikepa oge li popepi unene naashoka sha li oshihongwa. Etaleko lyokukonakona okoda ne prototipa ya GPL olya ningwa mefiku <0/>, netalo lyaaleli lyomafaneko gawo olyo li li mokulongwa. Shoka sha zi po otashi shangwa ishewe nenge sha ungaungwa ishewe. Fiyo etalo li wapale, katu tothi kutya eyamukulo olo hasho.",
  "faq.questions": "Omapulo",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Iikepa, oshihongwa, eintafeisi nashiwike, ngaashi oimaliwa tayi pitika. <0>Oshitenda mepandja eli<\/0> otashi holola oshinima keshe ndele otashi holola eshi keshe lyi lukilwe nomudizaina gwalyo.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "Iikepa nomayelekeko oya pangelwa okumonika pokudhana nenge okulandwa. Iikepa ya futwa tayi kala ya pamwe mokulwa komunhu nomunhu natango otayi pangwa.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "Eyo oyo epango: okudhana okwa ehameka nooimaliwa yogeyimi niikwatelo ya hokiwa. Inai ningwa natango.",
  "faq.wasAnyoneS": "Oilonga yomunhu oya kopwa?",
  "faq.whenOutWhat": "Otai ya uyali, ndele peni?",
  "faq.whichPartsWill": "Omathimbo geni aantu taa ga lukile, ndele ondi ka tseya ngiini?",
  "faq.whyWouldAi": "Omolwashike ogeyimi ya ningwa kAI tai kwatha aadizaina?",
  "faq.willPayWin": "Otai kala ogeyimi yokufuta opo u kondje?",
  "faq.windowsPcThere": "PC yaWindows. Kape na efiku lyokuya nenge oshimaliwa natango.",
  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Anthropic, Claude na Claude Code oiyemo yomaina gaAnthropic, PBC. Unreal Engine naEpic Games oiyemo yomaina gaEpic Games, Inc. Blender oyemo yomaina gaBlender Foundation. Quake III Arena naElite Dangerous oiyemo yomaina gomaenekelwa gawo. Omadhina aeshe oge li yaanamwene yawo ndele ge ya longithwa ashike opo ge tseyithe iikwatelo yi popiwa. Orion-81 ke li pamwe, kai futhwa nenge kai yi dhanekwa kosha shimwe shawo.",
  "footer.aspirationalNoPartnership": "Etalekelo. Kape na ekwatafano, ehangano nenge ethaneko.",
  "footer.channelComing": "Ekanale otali ya",
  "footer.devlogYoutube": "Devlog pa YouTube",
  "footer.followKickstarter": "Landula Kickstarter",
  "footer.futurePartners": "Aakwatafani yongula?",
  "footer.noTrackersNo": "Kape na aakonakoni. Kape na omakuki. Oshitopolwa shokutala komatango. Oshitumbulwa keshe ohashi hanga moarkivi yoprojekta; kape na shoka shi li oshitopolwa shokuha nenge epango.",
  "footer.notLiveYet": "Inai holoka natango",
  "footer.oneItemStill": "Oshinima shimwe oshi li natango oshi yeulwa: <0>etalo lyelisensa<\/0> lyokoda yogeyimi ya zi koprototipa ya GPL. Etaleko lyokukonakona okoda ne gegameno lyoprototipa olya ningwa mefiku <1/>, netalo lyaaleli lyomafaneko gawo olyo li li mokulongwa.",
  "footer.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 oprojekta ya ningwa ayihe kAI.<\/0> Okoda yaOrion-81 yene ya shangwa ko Claude Code, ya tungilwa komutameki; iikepa, omakarata, oetekisitela nomaudhano ya ningwa kiilongitho ya shangwa ko Claude Code. Omalaibrari ya yeulwa ngoka ge ga longitha oga shangwa metango <1>«Ihe ya ningwa kAI»<\/1>.",
  "footer.siteFooterAriaLabel": "Ehulilo lyoshitopolwa",
